e famous  question of uh uh you know when you when  you ask the self-driving car to drive  above the speed limit what should it do  and um under what circumstances you know  and and what does the what does the law  say about that well it usually says you  know  if you if you need to go about the speed  limit for a really good reason you can  do it  um but uh uh and you know how does the  self-driving car assess was it a really  good reason you know oh to avoid an  accident oh to do this or that um and  you know the way that these things are  set up now it's very much well if the  human thought this  even if the human was wrong it's okay  but and then  when it's a kind of an ai system how  does that uh  how does one decide whether it was  reasonable for it to have thought that  and so on  all right well lots of interesting  questions and and things  to discuss there so we've gone from the  atoms of space  to uh cat-moving robots  um and uh well hope people found this  interesting you know i always  find these fun because uh you'll get me  to think about things that i don't  normally think about and it's kind of a  great exercise for for my brain at least  of um  of thinking about all these different  kinds of things and  the connections between them so please  uh  feel free to  to suggest topics ask questions i on our  uh the form that we have out there and  um  look forward to being with you another  time  so thanks very much
 

